Photorealistic cyberpunk user-interface asset: one single long horizontal progress bar channel, viewed perfectly straight-on, centered, spanning 90 percent of the image width and about one quarter of its height, isolated on a pure flat black background. Shape: long bar with sharply chamfered cut corners. Frame: dark carbon fibre and anodised gunmetal bezel with a thin electric cyan neon edge. Inside: a recessed channel of matte black. Running the full length of the channel, a musical staff of exactly five thin, perfectly straight, evenly spaced, parallel horizontal lines made of fine glowing cyan laser light. At the far left of the staff, one treble clef made of hot magenta neon tube. Nothing else on the staff: no notes, no bar lines, no numbers, no text. Product photography, crisp focus. One object only, no watermark.
